OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 10 JUN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GRelax into a soothing mixtape of
OL,6,     Gmusic by Mozart, Brahms, Schubert
OL,7,     Gand Handel.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GHumanity's frailty and fortitude
OL,10,     Gcombine in Mahler's existential
OL,11,     GSymphony No.6, as Principle
OL,12,     GConductor Kahchun Wong conducts
OL,13,     Gthe Halle Orchestra.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: Musicians on the Couch
OL,15,     GHow does music affect the mind?
OL,16,     GWriter Amanda Dalton considers
OL,17,     Ghow music can reach people when
OL,18,     Gnothing else can, inspired by
OL,19,     GMargart Tilly, music therapist
OL,20,     Gand concert pianist.
