OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 10 JUN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto is joined once again by
OL,12,     GChicago-based cellist and
OL,13,     Gcomposer Tomeka Reid, as she
OL,14,     Greturns with a third selection
OL,15,     Gfrom her collection.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GFrom the Ukrainian Radio studios
OL,18,     Gin Kyiv, the Platon Maiboroda
OL,19,     GAcademic Choir of Ukrainian
OL,20,     GRadio, Liatoshynskyi Capella, and
OL,21,     Gconductor Yuliia Tkach perform
OL,22,     GPergolesi's Stabat Mater.
